    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkumīlīja kwa ng'wa Hana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hana ūkumīlīja alīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būbi wa nhūngwa ja Bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bitūnja ba ng'wa Eli baalī banhū baabūbi no, nguno baalī batandīlīīlaga ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenījo a bagabīji baalī na shīmīle sha kūzubūla nyama ūlū jilīzugwa; ūlū munhū ūfunya shitambò, ī nyama ūlū īlīzugwa, ntūmami wa ngabīji wizaga abūūkije mu nkono līntī lya mahagala adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabizaga ūlū washika ho wachima nī līntī ū mu shiseme īsho baazugīlaga, lībize isabīga, nūūlū nungū, nūūlū nengelo nūūlū ifulila. Ī nyama īyo īlaazubūlwe mo wasolaga ngabīji yabiza yaakwe. H'ūmo babīītīlaga a Baisilaeli a bose abo bizaga ī Shilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nūūlū gataalī ū kūpya a mazezele gayo ī nyama, ū ntūmami wa ngabīji wizaga ū kūlī munhū ūyo alīfunya ī shitambò wang'wīla, “Ng'winhage ū ngabīji nyama ya koocha, atatogilwe ū kūsola nyama ya būzuge ū kūfuma ū kūlī bebe, atogilwe mbīsī dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū ūhaya, “Lembeelaga tame gapye a mazezele gīnge ho, hūna ūsole īyo ūlaatogwe bebe ng'wenekīlī.” Ū ntūmami ng'wenūyo wahayaga, “Yaya ī gīko, ninhage dūhū ī haha yenīyī, ūlū ūlīlema nakūsola bo nguzu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būbi wenūbū ū wa basūmba benaba walī būtaale no ū kūlī SEEBA, nguno ū mu kwīta gīko baashitūmamīlaga mu būdalahi būtaale ī shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli akandya kūtūmama ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ataalī nyanda ndo, wazwaalaga ifoodi ya kitaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'waka ū nina wameegejaga ng'hanjo ya kūyūzwala wantwalīla ūlū alīja nū ngoshi kūjūūfunya shitambò sha būlī ng'waka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eli nang'hwe wamfuuhaga ū Elikana nū nke wakwe wang'wīla, “Ū SEEBA akwinhe baana bangī mu nzīla ya nkīma ng'wenūyū, babize a ha ng'wanya gwakwe ūyo akanomba ūng'winha, ūyo wang'winhile kūlī SEEBA.” Hanuma ya henaho bīngaga baashoka kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akanchīla shigongo ū Hana, ūdūla kūbūūcha nda na kūbyala baana bangī, bayanda badatū na baanikī babīlī. Ū nyanda ū Sang'weli ongeja kūkūla alī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ū Eli walī wanamhaala no, alīyo wīyigwaaga pyī īyo bitūnja bakwe babīītīlaga a Baisilaeli a bose, nī gīkī balaalaga na a bakīma abo baatūmamaga a ha nyango gwa kwingīlīla ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “Bing'we nibūlī mukwītaga mihayo īlī gīko? Nalībigwa pye banhū bakwīhooyelaga ī mihayo ying'we ī yabūbi īyo mukwīyītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ī gīko baana bane, ī mihayo īyo nakwīyigwaaga īyo yasambaalile hose pye ū mu banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA īlī yabūbi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūng'hūba munhū ng'wiye, ū Mulungu adūgije ū kūbasangīja a banhū benabo, alīyo ūlū munhū ūng'hūba SEEBA, nani ū wa kūnombela?” Gwike a bitūnja bakwe batabūdīlīīlile ū būhūgūji bo ng'wa Saabo, nguno ū SEEBA walī atogilwe kūbabūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nyanda ū Sang'weli ongeja kūkūla ū mu mīlī nū mu kūnyeja ū SEEBA hamò na a banhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi wa kūkenaagūka kaya ya ng'wa Eli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū nebe o ng'wa Mulungu akiza ū kūlī Eli ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Angū natiyolekije hape hape ū kū numba ya nkūlūgeji wako, aho baalī mu sī ya Misili ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo ng'wa Falao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī nataansolile ū nkūlūgenji wako kūfuma ū mu ng'anda ī jose ja Baisilaeli gīkī abize ngabīji wane, wa kwīmīīla kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo gwane na kūzuukīja ho būbbani na kūzwala ifoodi, kū būtongi wane? Nī shakwinha shane ī shose natayinhile ī kaya ya nkūlūgenji wako, pyī nī shakwinha ī shose īsho shikafunyiagwa na Baisilaeli mu nzīla ya moto? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali nibūlī mukūshidalahaga ī shitambò shane nī shakwinha īsho nashisola gīkī shibizūfunyiwa ū mu numba yane? Nguno kī ūkūbachīlaga minala a baana bako kūtinda kūnikūja ū nene? Nguno mukūshilyaga ī shakwinha shawiza īsho shisolilwe mu shose, īsho shikūfunyiagwa na banhū bane Baisilaeli, gīkī ng'wigīnye bing'we dūhū!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli alīhaya, ‘Naalī naalahīla gīkī ī numba yako nī numba ya nkūlūgenji wako īkūtūmama kū būtongi wane shikū ja weleelo bose.’ Alīyo ī haha ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū gwenūyo ni gūsegenelage gūnīngīle! Nguno abo banikūgije nū nene nakūbakūja, alīyo abo banidalahile bakūbalwa kūbiza batī na ngofyoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama managa gīkī līliiza ikanza īlo nakūjīnja gete ī nguzu jako nī nguzu ja nkūlūgenji wako, kūshisha atilonga wa kūshika kū būnamhala ū mu kaya ya ng'wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūkūyūshilola mu kūshiikūmvwa no ī shawiza īsho bakwītīlwa Baisilaeli, alīyo ū mu kaya yako atilonga nūūlū ūmò wa kūnamhaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ūyo nakūneka ho a ha nīmo gwa ha ng'walīlo gwane, akūlekwa ho kūlwa kūkūlīja shiisoji sha kūkūbbokuja miso gako dūhū, na kūkūpīnīhaja ng'holò yako, nīyo a banhū ba shibyalīlwe shako bakūcha ng'wikanza īlo būpanga būkanonelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo gūkūbagwīīla a bitūnja bako a babīlī ū Hofuni nū Finehasi gūkūbiza būlolelo wa yenīyo ū kūlī bebe, bose būbīlī wabo bakūcha lūshikū lūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nene nakūtūūla ho ngabīji ūngī kūlwa nguno yane; ū ng'wenūyo akwīshikīlīja īyo īlī ū mu ng'holò yane na mu maganiko gane. Hama ī numba yakwe nakwīguzuhya, abize ntūmami kū būtongi wa ng'witīīlwa maguta wane shikū jose ja welelo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
